{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you combine multiple planets in one turn, you get a comb. Combos drastically increase your points, especially when combined with...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/7183c218c20a7053a0e6e3d893e6780b.poster.avif?t=1752531049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/7183c218c20a7053a0e6e3d893e6780b.webm?t=1752531049\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/7183c218c20a7053a0e6e3d893e6780b.mp4?t=1752531049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abilities - There are six abilities at your disposable. For example use lightning to destroy the pesky planet in the way between two suns or use the satellite to see what planets are coming in the next three turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/44ea66ab6101fe03d74e03f959fb3c62.poster.avif?t=1752531049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/44ea66ab6101fe03d74e03f959fb3c62.webm?t=1752531049\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861560/extras/44ea66ab6101fe03d74e03f959fb3c62.mp4?t=1752531049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also special types of planets. For example golden planets can combine with anything and bomb planets explode after a certain number of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\